pp and complete WiFi configuration via BLE.",a2:"Make sure you're using a 2.4GHz WiFi network (5GHz not supported). Check the password. Restart the device and connect within 60 seconds.",a3:"Solid green: System running. Blinking blue: BLE mode. Yellow: Searching GPS. Red: Error. See LED Indicators page for details.",q1:"How do I set up the GPS device?",q2:"The device can't connect to WiFi, what should I do?",q3:"What do the LED lights mean?",title:"Technical Support"},title:"Help Center",troubleshooting:"Troubleshooting",vehicles:{a1:"You can see your vehicle's real-time location on the Dashboard map. Location updates every 5 seconds.",a2:"Check the GPS device power connection. Inspect the LED indicators on the device. Verify the internet connection.",a3:"Yes, you can see all your vehicles on the Live Map screen in the Admin panel.",q1:"How can I see my vehicle's location?",q2:"My vehicle appears offline, what should I do?",q3:"Can I track multiple vehicles at once?",title:"Vehicles & Tracking"}},taskOffers:{checkInternet:"Check your internet connection.",connectionIssue:"Connection issue, retrying... ({{current}}/{{max}})",empty:{couldNotLoad:"Offers could not be loaded",error:"\u011f\u0178\u02dc\u201d",noPending:"No pending offers",normal:"\u011f\u0178\u201c\xad",notFound:"No task offers found"},filters:{accepted:"Accepted",all:"All",pending:"Pending",rejected:"Rejected"},genericError:"An error occurred. Please try again.",loading:"Loading offers...",noPermission:"You do not have permission for this operation.",offersNotFound:"Offers not found.",retry:"Retry",serverError:"Server error. Please try again later.",sessionExpired:"Session expired. Please login again.",statuses:{accepted:"Accepted",expired:"Expired",pending:"Pending",rejected:"Rejected"},tapForDetails:"Tap for details \xe2\u2020\u2019",timeRemaining:{expired:"Expired",hours:"{{hours}} hour(s) left",minutes:"{{minutes}} min left"},title:"Task Offers"},troubleshooting:{contactUs:"Contact our technical sup