atiye terxankirin red bikim?",a3:"Ere, erke bibinin u vebijarka 'Red bike' bikarbinin. Ji we re sebebek te xwestin."},technical:{title:"Pishtgiria tekniki",q1:"Ez cawa cihaze GPS saz dikim?",a1:"Cihaze bi porta USB ya wesaite ve girhedin. Di sepane de koda QR bixwinin u veavakirina WiFi bi BLE temam bikin.",q2:"Cihaz nikare bi WiFi ve bigirde, ez ci bikim?",a2:"Bisekinin ku hune tora WiFi 2.4GHz bikarbinin (5GHz nayete pishtgiri). Shifre kontrol bikin. Ji nu ve bidin u di 60 saniyan de bigirhedin.",q3:"Roniya LED ci wate ne?",a3:"Kesk sabit: Pergal dixebite. Shin dibirisqe: Moda BLE. Zer: GPS te geriandin. Sor: Xeleti. Ji bo hurdeman li Nishangeran LED binerin."},contact:{title:"Hishta aliqariye hewce ye?",subtitle:"Heke pirsa we li vir nine, bi tima pishtgiriye re peywendiye daynin",button:"Imail bishin"},footer:"\xc3\x83\xe2\x80\x9a\xc3\x82\xc2\xa9 2026 TulipFleet - Hemmu maf parastin"},troubleshooting:{title:"\xc7areserkirina Pirsgir\xeakan",tapToExpand:"Ji bo h\xfbrguliyan bitik\xeene",solution:"\xc7areser\xee",stepsToTry:"Gav\xean ku Bicerib\xeenin",stillNeedHelp:"H\xea j\xee al\xeekar\xee hewce dike?",contactUs:"Bi t\xeema pi\u015ftgiriya tekn\xeek re t\xeakil\xee daynin",problems:{noPower:"C\xeehaz venabe",noGps:"S\xeenyala GPS tune",noWifi:"Xeletiya gir\xeadana WiFi",noBle:"Bluetooth nehat d\xeetin",noUpdate:"C\xeeh nay\xea n\xfbkirin",appCrash:"Sepan dikeve"},solutions:{noPower:"Gir\xeadana h\xeaz\xea \xfb sigort\xea kontrol bikin.",noGps:"Antena GPS ber bi ezm\xfbn vekirin ve bikin.",noWifi:"\u015e\xeefreya WiFi \xfb m\xeeheng\xean tor\xea kontrol bikin.",noBle:"C\xeehaz\xea ji n\xfb ve bidin destp\xeakirin \xfb di 60 saniyeyan de gir\xeadin.",noUpdate:"Gir\xeadana \xeenternet\xea \xfb rew\u015fa server\xea kontrol bikin.",appCrash:"Sepan\xea n\xfb bikin an cache paqij bikin."},steps:{checkPowerConnection:"Gir\xeadana kabloya h\xeaz\xea kontrol bikin",checkFuse:"Sigortaya wesay\xeet\xea kontrol bikin",checkVoltage:"Navbera voltaja 12V-24V verast bikin",mov