 bo armanca EU 2026 %{{percent}} ba\u015ftirkirina din lazim e",bmFleet:"F\xeeloya Te",bmSectorAvg:"Nav. Sektor\xea",bmBelow:"%{{percent}} li j\xear sektor\xea",bmAbove:"%{{percent}} li ser sektor\xea",bmYou:"Tu",driverScore:"puan",noBadge:"B\xeatir tomar bike \u2192 n\xee\u015fan bi dest bixe",unassigned:"Nehatiye Destn\xee\u015fankirin",emission:"Belavkirin",bmHeavyTruck:"Kamyona Giran",bmMediumTruck:"Kamyona Nav\xeen",bmLightCommercial:"Bazirganiya Sivik",bmVan:"Panelvan",bmCar:"Otomob\xeel"},privacy:{lastUpdated:"N\xfbvekirina daw\xee",s1Title:"1. Destp\xeak",s1Body:"TulipFleet (\"em\", \"me\") platformek bir\xeavebirina f\xeeloy\xea bi sepan\xean mob\xeel \xfb am\xfbr\xean IoT-\xea dime\u015f\xeene. Ev Siyaseta Nepen\xeetiy\xea rave dike ku em \xe7awa daney\xean weya kesane berhev dikin, bi kar t\xeenin, hildipar\xeazin \xfb dipar\xeazin li gor\xee R\xeaziknamey\xean Gi\u015ft\xee y\xean Parastina Daneyan (GDPR) \xfb qan\xfbn\xean parastina daney\xean p\xeakan\xeen.",s2Title:"2. Daney\xean ku em berhev dikin",s2Body:"Em van kategoriy\xean daneyan berhev dikin:\n\n\u2022 Agahdariya Hesab: Nav, navn\xee\u015fana e-namey\xea, jimareya t\xealefon\xea, nav\xea parg\xeedaniy\xea\n\u2022 Daney\xean Wesay\xeet\xea: Plaka, marka, model, curey\xea sotemeniy\xea, k\xeelometre\n\u2022 Daney\xean C\xeeh\xea: Koord\xeenat\xean GPS-\xea y\xean zind\xee ji am\xfbr\xean IoT-\xea y\xean di wesay\xeetan de\n\u2022 Daney\xean Ajotin\xea: Lez, b\xfbyer\xean lezb\xfbn\xea, \u015f\xeawaz\xean frenkirin\xea, d\xeeroka r\xea\n\u2022 Daney\xean Am\xfbr\xea: Nasnamey\xean am\xfbra ESP32, guhertoya firmware, rew\u015fa gir\xeadan\xea\n\u2022 Daney\xean Bikaran\xeen\xea: \u015e\xeawaz\xean bikaran\xeena sepan\xea, dan\xfbstandin\xean taybetmendiyan, demjim\xear\xean t\xeaketin\xea",s3Title:"3. Em daney\xean we \xe7awa bikar t\xeenin",s3Body:"Daney\xean we ji bo van armancan t\xeane bikaran\xeen:\n\n\u2022 Bir\xeavebirina F\xeeloy\xea: \u015eopandina wesay\xeetan a zind\xee, xwe\u015fkirina r\xea, peywirkirina erkan\n\u2022 \xc7avd\xeariya Ewlehiy\xea: Tesp\xeetkirina frena hi\u015fk, lezb\xfbn \xfb b\xfbyer\xean l\xeadan\xea\n\u2022 Raportkirin: Rapor\xean performansa f\xeeloy\xea, anal\xeez\xean xerckirina sotemeniy\xea\n\u2022 Dan\xfbstandin: Agahdariy\xean push ji bo n\xfbvekirina erkan, hi\u015fyariyan \xfb peyam\xean pergal\xea\n\u2022 Ba\u015fkirina Xizmet\xea: Anal\xeezkirina \u015f\xeawaz\xean bikaran\xeen\xea ji bo ba\u015fkirina platform\xea",s4Title:"4. Hilan\xeen \xfb Ewlehiya Daneyan",s4Body:"\u2022 Hem\xfb dane li ser server\xean ewledar \xean di nav Yek\xeetiya Ewropay\xea de (Hetzner, Almanya) t\xeane hilan\xeen\n\u2022 Veguhastina daneyan bi TLS/SSL ve t\xea \u015f\xeefrekirin\n\u2022 Ragihandina MQTT \u015f\xeefrekirina TLS-\xea bikar t\xeene\n\u2022 \u015e\xeefre bi bcrypt ve t\xeane hashkirin\n\u2022 Ji bo er\xeakirin\xea token\xean JWT bi dema qedandina otomat\xeek t\xeane bikaran\xeen\n\u2022 Daney\xean c\xeeh\xea 7 rojan t\xeane hilan\xeen, pi\u015ftre bixweber t\xeane j\xeabirin\n\u2022 Kontrol\xean ewlehiy\xea \xfb test\xean penetrasyon\xea bi r\xeak\xfbp\xeak t\xeane kirin",s5Title:"5. Parvekirina Daneyan",s5Body:"Em daney\xean weya kesane li aliy\xean s\xeayem\xeen nafiro\u015fin. Dane dikarin bi van re b\xean parve kirin:\n\n\u2022 R\xeavebir\xea Parg\xeedaniya We: R\xeavebir\xean f\xeeloy\xea dikarin daney\xean wesay\xeet \xfb ajokar di nav r\xeaxistina xwe de bib\xeenin\n\u2022 Google Maps API: Ji bo hesabkirina r\xea \xfb n\xee\u015fandana nex\u015fey\xea (anon\xeem)\n\u2022 Firebase: Ji bo \u015fandina agahdariy\xean push\n\u2022 P\xeadiviy\xean Qan\xfbn\xee: Dema ku ji h\xeala qan\xfbn an p\xeavajoy\xean qan\xfbn\xee ve t\xea xwestin",s6Title:"6. Maf\xean We (GDPR)",s6Body:"Li gor\xee GDPR-\xea, maf\xean we hene:\n\n\u2022 Gih\xee\u015ftin: Kopiyek daney\xean xwe y\xean kesane bixwazin\n\u2022 Rastkirina: Daney\xean kesane y\xean \xe7ewt rast bikin\n\u2022 J\xeabirin: J\xeabirina daney\xean xwe y\xean kesane bixwazin\n\u2022 Veguhastin: Daney\xean xwe di formatek bir\xeak\xfbp\xeak \xfb ji h\xeala mak\xeeney\xea ve xwend\xee de werbigirin\n\u2022 S\xeenorkirin: P\xeavajoya daney\xean xwe s\xeenordar bikin\n\u2022 \xcetiraz: Li dij\xee p\xeavajoya daneyan a li ser bingeha berjewendiy\xean qan\xfbn\xee \xeetiraz bikin\n\nJi bo bikaran\xeena van mafan, bi me re t\xeakil\xee daynin: destek@tulipfleet.com",s7Title:"7. T\xeakil\xee",s7Body:"TulipFleet\nE-name: destek@tulipfleet.com\nMalper: https://tulipfleet.com\n\n\xa9 2025-2026 TulipFleet. Hem\xfb maf parast\xee ne."},wifi:{ssid:"Nav\xea Tor\xea",password:"\u015e\xeefre",connect:"Gir\xeade",connecting:"Gir\xeadide...",connected:"Gir\xeaday\xee",errors:{authFailed:"\u015e\xeefreya xelet",timeout:"Dema gir\xeadan\xea derbas b\xfb",notFound:"Tor nehat d\xeetin"}},ble:{scanning:"L\xeager\xeen...",connecting:"Gir\xeadide...",connected:"Gir\xeaday\xee",disconnected:"Qut b\xfb",noDevices:"C\xeehaz nehat d\xeetin",permissionRequired:"Dest\xfbra Bluetooth hewce ye"},drawer:{fleetManagement:"Pergala R\xeavebiriya Flotey\xea",user:"Bikarh\xeaner"},tasks:{title:"Peywir",active:"\xc7alak",history:"D\xeerok",performanceAnalysis:"Anal\xeeza Performans\xea",completed:"Temam",totalKm:"KM Gi\u015ft\xee",timeAnalysis:"Anal\xeeza Dem\xea",avgDuration:"Dema Nav\xeen",onTime:"Di Dem\xea de",delayed:"Dereng",fuelEmission:"Sotemen\xee \xfb Em\xeesyon",total:"Gi\u015ft\xee",routeDistribution:"Belavkirina R\xeay\xea",city:"Bajar",highway:"Otoban",safety:"Ewleh\xee",score:"Puan",accident:"Qeza",hardBrake:"Fr\xeana Zor",energySource:"\xc7avkaniya Enerjiy\xea",electric:"Elektr\xeek",fossil:"Fos\xeel",avg:"Nav\xeen",max:"Her\xee Z\xeade",min:"Her\xee K\xeam",pendingOffers:"P\xea\u015fniyar\xean li Bend\xea",newOffersWaiting:"P\xea\u015fniyar\xean n\xfb li bend\xea ne",tasksWaitingApproval:"Peywir li bend\xea er\xeakirin\xea ne",reviewCardsBelow:"Kart\xean j\xear\xeen kontrol bikin",newTaskOffer:"P\xea\u015fniyara Peywira N\xfb",processing:"T\xea kirin...",rejec