z. Konum 5 saniyede bir g\xfcncellenir.",q2:"Ara\xe7 \xe7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor, ne yapmal\u0131y\u0131m?",a2:"GPS cihaz\u0131n\u0131n g\xfc\xe7 ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin. Cihaz \xfczerindeki LED g\xf6stergelerini inceleyin. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n.",q3:"Birden fazla arac\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda takip edebilir miyim?",a3:"Evet, Admin panelindeki Canl\u0131 Harita ekran\u0131nda t\xfcm ara\xe7lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda g\xf6rebilirsiniz."},tasks:{title:"G\xf6revler",q1:"Bana atanan g\xf6revi nas\u0131l kabul ederim?",a1:"Dashboard'da gelen g\xf6revi g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyin ve 'Kabul Et' butonuna bas\u0131n. G\xf6revi ba\u015flatmak i\xe7in 'G\xf6reve Ba\u015fla' se\xe7ene\u011fini kullan\u0131n.",q2:"Bir g\xf6revi tamamland\u0131 olarak nas\u0131l i\u015faretlerim?",a2:"G\xf6rev detaylar\u0131na girin ve 'G\xf6revi Tamamla' butonuna bas\u0131n. Gerekli bilgileri doldurup onaylay\u0131n.",q3:"Atanm\u0131\u015f bir g\xf6revi reddedebilir miyim?",a3:"Evet, gelen g\xf6revi g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyip 'Reddet' se\xe7ene\u011fini kullanabilirsiniz. Red sebebini belirtmeniz istenecektir."},technical:{title:"Teknik Destek",q1:"GPS cihaz\u0131n\u0131 nas\u0131l kurar\u0131m?",a1:"Cihaz\u0131 ara\xe7 USB portuna ba\u011flay\u0131n. Mobil uygulamada QR kod okutarak BLE ile WiFi yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131n\u0131 tamamlay\u0131n.",q2:"Cihaz WiFi'a ba\u011flanam\u0131yor, ne yapmal\u0131y\u0131m?",a2:"2.4GHz WiFi a\u011f\u0131 kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zdan emin olun (5GHz desteklenmez). \u015eifreyi kontrol edin. Cihaz\u0131 yeniden ba\u015flat\u0131p 60 saniye i\xe7inde ba\u011flan\u0131n.",q3:"LED \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ne anlama geliyor?",a3:"Ye\u015fil sabit: Sistem \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Mavi yan\u0131p s\xf6nen: BLE modu. Sar\u0131: GPS aran\u0131yor. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131: Hata. Detaylar i\xe7in LED G\xf6stergeleri sayfas\u0131na bak\u0131n."},contact:{title:"H\xe2l\