elleme",s1Title:"1. Giri\u015f",s1Body:"TulipFleet (\"biz\", \"bizim\") mobil uygulamalar ve IoT cihazlar\u0131 i\xe7eren bir filo y\xf6netim platformu i\u015fletmektedir. Bu Gizlilik Politikas\u0131, Genel Veri Koruma T\xfcz\xfc\u011f\xfc (GDPR) ve y\xfcr\xfcrl\xfckteki veri koruma yasalar\u0131na uygun olarak ki\u015fisel verilerinizi nas\u0131l toplad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131, kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131, saklad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 ve korudu\u011fumuzu a\xe7\u0131klamaktad\u0131r.",s2Title:"2. Toplad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z Veriler",s2Body:"A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kategorilerde veri topluyoruz:\n\n\u2022 Hesap Bilgileri: Ad, soyad, e-posta adresi, telefon numaras\u0131, \u015firket ad\u0131\n\u2022 Ara\xe7 Verileri: Plaka, marka, model, yak\u0131t tipi, kilometre\n\u2022 Konum Verileri: Ara\xe7lara tak\u0131l\u0131 IoT cihazlar\u0131ndan al\u0131nan anl\u0131k GPS koordinatlar\u0131\n\u2022 S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Verileri: H\u0131z, ani h\u0131zlanma olaylar\u0131, fren kal\u0131plar\u0131, rota ge\xe7mi\u015fi\n\u2022 Cihaz Verileri: ESP32 cihaz tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131, firmware s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc, ba\u011flant\u0131 durumu\n\u2022 Kullan\u0131m Verileri: Uygulama kullan\u0131m kal\u0131plar\u0131, \xf6zellik etkile\u015fimleri, giri\u015f zaman damgalar\u0131",s3Title:"3. Verilerinizi Nas\u0131l Kullan\u0131yoruz",s3Body:"Verileriniz \u015fu ama\xe7larla kullan\u0131lmaktad\u0131r:\n\n\u2022 Filo Y\xf6netimi: Anl\u0131k ara\xe7 takibi, rota optimizasyonu, g\xf6rev atama\n\u2022 G\xfcvenlik \u0130zleme: Ani fren, h\u0131zlanma ve \xe7arpma olaylar\u0131n\u0131n tespiti\n\u2022 Raporlama: Filo performans raporlar\u0131, yak\u0131t t\xfcketimi analizleri\n\u2022 \u0130leti\u015fim: G\xf6rev g\xfcncellemeleri, uyar\u0131lar ve sistem mesajlar\u0131 i\xe7in bildirimler\n\u2022 Hizmet \u0130yile\u015ftirme: Platformu geli\u015ftirmek i\xe7in kullan\u0131m kal\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131n analizi",s4Title:"4. Veri Saklama ve G\xfcvenlik",s4Body:"\u2022 T\xfcm veriler Avrupa Birli\u011fi i\xe7indeki g\xfcvenli sunucularda saklanmaktad\u0131r (Hetzner, Almanya)\n\u2022 Veri aktar\u0131m\u0131 TLS/SSL ile \u015fifrelenmektedir\n\u2022 MQTT ileti\u015fimi TLS \u015fifreleme kullanmaktad\u0131r\n\u2022 \u015eifreler bcrypt ile hashlenmektedir\n\u2022 Kimlik do\u011frulama i\xe7in otomatik s\xfcre dolumu olan JWT token'lar kullan\u0131lmaktad\u0131r\n\u2022 Konum verileri 7 g\xfcn boyunca saklan\u0131r, ard\u0131ndan otomatik olarak silinir\n\u2022 D\xfczenli g\xfcvenlik denetimleri ve s\u0131zma testleri yap\u0131lmaktad\u0131r",s5Title:"5. Veri Payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131",s5Body:"Ki\u015fisel verilerinizi \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc taraflara satm\u0131yoruz. Veriler \u015fu taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131labilir:\n\n\u2022 \u015eirket Y\xf6neticiniz: Filo y\xf6neticileri kendi organizasyonlar\u0131ndaki ara\xe7 ve s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc verilerini g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyebilir\n\u2022 Google Maps API: Rota hesaplama ve harita g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleme i\xe7in (anonimle\u015ftirilmi\u015f)\n\u2022 Firebase: Bildirim g\xf6nderimi i\xe7in\n\u2022 Yasal Gereklilikler: Yasa veya yasal i\u015flemler gerektirdi\u011finde",s6Title:"6. Haklar\u0131n\u0131z (GDPR)",s6Body:"GDPR kapsam\u0131nda a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki haklara sahipsiniz:\n\n\u2022 Eri\u015fim: Ki\u015fisel verilerinizin bir kopyas\u0131n\u0131 talep etme\n\u2022 D\xfczeltme: Yanl\u0131\u015f ki\u015fisel verilerin d\xfczeltilmesi\n\u2022 Silme: Ki\u015fisel verilerinizin silinmesini talep etme\n\u2022 Ta\u015f\u0131nabilirlik: Verilerinizi yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f, makine taraf\u0131ndan okunabilir formatta alma\n\u2022 K\u0131s\u0131tlama: Verilerinizin i\u015flenmesini k\u0131s\u0131tlama\n\u2022 \u0130tiraz: Me\u015fru menfaatlere dayal\u0131 veri i\u015flemeye itiraz etme\n\nBu haklar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kullanmak i\xe7in bize ula\u015f\u0131n: destek@tulipfleet.com",s7Title:"7. \u0130leti\u015fim",s7Body:"TulipFleet\nE-posta: destek@tulipfleet.com\nWeb: https://tulipfleet.com\n\n\xa9 2025-2026 TulipFleet. T\xfcm haklar\u0131 sakl\u0131d\u0131r."},drawer:{fleetManagement:"Filo Y\xf6netim Sistemi",user:"Kullan\u0131c\u0131"},adminDrivers:{filterAll:"T\xfcm\xfc",filterAvailable:"M\xfcsait",filterOnTask:"G\xf6revde",filterOffline:"\xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131",vehicle:"Ara\xe7",tasks:"G\xf6revler",score:"Puan",assignedVehicle:"Atanan Ara\xe7",license:"Ehliyet",phone:"Telefon",emergency:"Acil Durum",totalKm:"Toplam KM",unnamed:"\u0130simsiz",noDrivers:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yok",noDriversDesc:"Kay\u0131tl\u0131 s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc bulunamad\u0131",loading:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfcler y\xfckleniyor...",loadError:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfcler y\xfcklenemedi",deleteDriver:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfcy\xfc Sil",deleteConfirm:"Bu s\xfcr\xfcc\xfcy\xfc silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?",driverDeleted:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc ba\u015far\u0131yla silindi",deleteFailed:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc silinemedi"},adminVehicles:{filterAll:"T\xfcm\xfc",filterAvailable:"M\xfcsait",filterInUse:"Kullan\u0131mda",filterOther:"Di\u011fer",fuel:"Yak\u0131t",offline:"\xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131",online:"\xc7evrimi\xe7i",track:"Takip",device:"Cihaz",color:"Renk",category:"Kategori",fuelType:"Yak\u0131t Tipi",tankCapacity:"Depo Kapasitesi",lastMaint:"Son Bak\u0131m",loading:"Ara\xe7lar y\xfckleniyor...",loadError:"Ara\xe7lar y\xfcklenemedi",noVehicles:"Ara\xe7 Yok",noVehiclesDesc:"Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ara\xe7 bulunamad\u0131",deleteVehicle:"Arac\u0131 Sil",deleteConfirm:"Bu arac\u0131 silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?",vehicleDeleted:"Ara\xe7 ba\u015far\u0131yla silindi",deleteFailed:"Ara\xe7 silinemedi"},adminTasks:{filterAll:"T\xfcm\xfc",filterPending:"Bekleyen",filterActive:"Aktif",filterCompleted:"Tamamlanan",driver:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc",noDriver:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yok",noDriverAssigned:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc atanmam\u0131\u015f",noVehicle:"Ara\xe7 Yok",distance:"Mesafe",from:"Nereden",to:"Nereye",scheduled:"Planlanan",notes:"Notlar",description:"A\xe7\u0131klama",priorityLabel:"\xd6ncelik",sendOf