RAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:O("privacy.s3Title")||"3. How We Use Your Data"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:O("privacy.s3Body")||"Your data is used for:\n\n\u2022 Fleet Management: Real-time vehicle tracking, route optimization, task assignment\n\u2022 Safety Monitoring: Detecting hard braking, acceleration, and impact events\n\u2022 Reporting: Generating fleet performance reports, fuel consumption analytics\n\u2022 Communication: Push notifications for task updates, alerts, and system messages\n\u2022 Service Improvement: Analyzing usage patterns to improve the platform"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:O("privacy.s4Title")||"4. Data Storage & Security"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:O("privacy.s4Body")||"\u2022 All data is stored on secure servers located within the European Union (Hetzner, Germany)\n\u2022 Data transmission is encrypted using TLS/SSL\n\u2022 MQTT communication uses TLS encryption\n\u2022 Passwords are hashed using bcrypt\n\u2022 JWT tokens are used for authentication with automatic expiry\n\u2022 Location data is retained for 7 days, then automatically purged\n\u2022 Regular security audits and penetration testing are conducted"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:O("privacy.s5Title")||"5. Data Sharing"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:O("privacy.s5Body")||"We do not sell your personal data to third parties. Data may be shared with:\n\n\u2022 Your Company Admin: Fleet managers can view vehicle and driver data within their organization\n\u2022 Google Maps API: For route calculation and map display (anonymized)\n\u2022 Firebase: For push notification delivery\n\u2022 Legal Requirements: When required by law or legal proceedings"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:O("privacy.s6Title")||"6. Your Rights (GDPR)"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:O("privacy.s6Body")||"Under GDPR, you have the right to:\n\n\u2022 Access: Request a copy of your personal data\n\u2022 Rectification: Correct inaccurate personal data\n\u2022 Erasure: Request deletion of your personal data\n\u2022 Portability: Receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format\n\u2022 Restriction: Restrict the processing of your data\n\u2022 Objection: Object to data processing based on legitimate interests\n\nTo exercise these rights, contact us at: destek@tulipfleet.com"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:O("privacy.s7Title")||"7. Contact"}),(0,P.jsx)(h.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:O("privacy.s7Body")||"TulipFleet\nEmail: destek@tulipfleet.com\nWebsite: https://tulipfleet.com\n\n\xa9 2025-2026 TulipFleet. All rights reserved."})]})]})})]})}},1827,[350,20,985,1091,1828,1835,73,1134,4,1969,1167,1178,1303,1168,253]);
