, store, and protect your personal data in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and applicable data protection laws."}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:"2. Data We Collect"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:"\u2022 Account Information: Name, email, phone, company\n\u2022 Vehicle Data: Plate, brand, model, fuel type, mileage\n\u2022 Location Data: Real-time GPS from IoT devices\n\u2022 Driving Data: Speed, acceleration, braking, routes\n\u2022 Device Data: ESP32 identifiers, firmware, connectivity\n\u2022 Usage Data: App patterns, login timestamps"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:"3. How We Use Your Data"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:"\u2022 Fleet Management: Vehicle tracking, route optimization\n\u2022 Safety Monitoring: Hard braking, acceleration events\n\u2022 Reporting: Performance reports, fuel analytics\n\u2022 Communication: Push notifications for tasks and alerts\n\u2022 Service Improvement: Usage analysis"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.lg,fontWeight:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.weights.bold,color:Y.TEXT,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.sm},children:"4. Data Storage & Security"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.sizes.md,color:Y.TEXT_SECONDARY,lineHeight:22,marginBottom:Y.SPACING.lg},children:"\u2022 Servers located in the EU (Germany)\n\u2022 TLS/SSL encryption for all data\n\u2022 MQTT with TLS encryption\n\u2022 Passwords hashed with bcrypt\n\u2022 JWT authentication with auto-expiry\n\u2022 Location data retained 7 days\n\u2022 Regular security audits"}),(0,C.jsx)(T.Text,{style:{fontSize:Y.TYPOGRAPHY.size